      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MACBETH.\nI am settled, and bend up\nEach corporal agent to this terrible feat.\nAway, and mock the time with fairest show:\nFalse face must hide what the false heart doth know.",
